jobs.description:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Figma is growing our team of passionate creatives and builders on a mission to make design accessible to all. Figma’s platform helps teams bring ideas to life—whether you&#39;re brainstorming, creating a prototype, translating designs into code, or iterating with AI. From idea to product, Figma empowers teams to streamline workflows, move faster, and work together in real time from anywhere in the world. If you&#39;re excited to shape the future of design and collaboration, join us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for a technically-minded product designer who is excited to shape how design, code, and AI-powered workflows come together at Figma. In this role, you&#39;ll improve how Figma understands production code and design systems, design workflows that move from design to code and back again, and extend Figma&#39;s agentic capabilities into developer tools and the places teams already work. You&#39;ll turn ambiguity into clarity alongside engineers, PMs, and researchers, bringing simplicity and craft to complex technical problems as we help define the future of how software is made.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a full-time role that can be held from our London hub or remotely within the UK.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do at Figma:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape and prototype new workflows that bring design and production code closer together, including AI-powered experiences that connect Figma with the tools teams already use to build&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to overall strategy and decision-making about product direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help deliver and refine clear storytelling around product needs and opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally with product management, engineering, UX writing, data science, and research peers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and iterate on flows, prototypes, and high-fidelity visuals, as well as provide thoughtful feedback for others doing the same so you can all do your best work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and ship high-quality features and product improvements in Figma&#39;s core product surfaces&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our design org&#39;s culture by participating in design critiques, mentoring peers, and sharing best practices across teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We&#39;d love to hear from you if you have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of experience designing UX and UI for software products of similar scale and complexity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong visual craft and attention to detail across composition, typography, layout, interaction design, and prototyping&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to independently drive end-to-end design processes from discovery through launch, balancing user needs, technical constraints, and business goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to guide decision-making through structured thinking, clear design rationale, and user-centered research&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing technically complex products, ideally developer tools or extensible platforms, with an understanding of software development workflows, APIs, and systems; experience prototyping and evaluating AI-powered or nondeterministic interactions is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;While it&#39;s not required, it&#39;s an added plus if you also have:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with web technologies like HTML/CSS, AI coding tools such as Codex, Cursor, or Claude Code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong understanding of advanced Figma features like Auto Layout, Variables, and Components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building with web technologies, APIs, CLIs, MCP, model evals, or other tools used to create developer and AI products&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A history of working on canvas-based interfaces or tools that support creative workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior work involving design systems, like creating, maintaining, or contributing to a design system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;section page-centered&quot;&gt;At Figma, one of our values is Grow as you go. We believe in hiring smart, curious people who are excited to learn and develop their skills. If you’re excited about this role but your past experience doesn’t align perfectly with the points outlined in the job description, we encourage you to apply anyways. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Figma we celebrate and support our differences. We know employing a team rich in diverse thoughts, experiences, and opinions allows our employees, our product and our community to flourish. Figma is an &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eeoc.gov/sites/default/files/2022-10/EEOC_KnowYourRights_screen_reader_10_20.pdf&quot;&gt;equal opportunity workplace&lt;/a&gt; - we are dedicated to equal employment opportunities regardless of race, color, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, gender identity/expression, veteran status&lt;strong&gt;, &lt;/strong&gt;or any other characteristic protected by law. We also consider qualified applicants regardless of criminal histories, consistent with legal requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We will work to ensure individuals with disabilities are provided reasonable accommodation to apply for a role, participate in the interview process, perform essential job functions, and receive other benefits and privileges of employment. If you require accommodation, please reach out to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:accommodations-ext@figma.com&quot;&gt;accommodations-ext@figma.com&lt;/a&gt;. These modifications enable an individual with a disability to have an equal opportunity not only to get a job, but successfully perform their job tasks to the same extent as people without disabilities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Examples of accommodations include but are not limited to:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Holding interviews in an accessible location&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enabling closed captioning on video conferencing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensuring all written communication be compatible with screen readers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Changing the mode or format of interviews&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To ensure the integrity of our hiring process and facilitate a more personal connection, we require all candidates keep their cameras on during video interviews. Additionally, if hired you will be required to attend in person onboarding.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By applying for this job, the candidate acknowledges and agrees that any personal data contained in their application or supporting materials will be processed in accordance with &lt;a class=&quot;c-link c-link--underline&quot; href=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://www.figma.com/legal/candidate-privacy-notice/&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Figma&#39;s Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;🚀 We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re waving goodbye to the complicated and confusing ways of traditional banking.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After starting as a prepaid card, our product offering has grown a lot in the last 10 years in the UK. As well as&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/personal&quot;&gt;personal&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/business-banking&quot;&gt;business&lt;/a&gt; bank accounts, we offer &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/joint-account&quot;&gt;joint accounts&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/16-17&quot;&gt;accounts for 16-17 year olds&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/current-account/under-16s&quot;&gt;free kids account&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/flex&quot;&gt;credit cards&lt;/a&gt; in the UK, with more exciting things to come beyond. Our UK customers can also &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/savings&quot;&gt;save&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/investments&quot;&gt;invest &lt;/a&gt;and&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/pensions&quot;&gt;combine their pensions&lt;/a&gt; with us.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With our hot coral cards and get-paid-early feature, combined with financial education on social media and our award winning customer service, we have a long history of creating magical moments for our customers!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re not about selling products - we want to solve problems and change lives through Monzo ❤️&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;📍London (Hybrid) / UK Remote | 💰 £90,000 - £120,000 + Incentive Awards tied to your performance +&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/careers#benefits&quot;&gt; Benefits&lt;/a&gt; ✨&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;⭐Our Design team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a team of 115+ designers, researchers, and brand experts led by Chief Design Officer Vuokko Aro. We’re on a mission to make money work for everyone. Product Design makes up over half of our design disciplines, working in tight-knit squads alongside research, product, engineering and data to solve real customer problems at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We design for the &quot;magic moments&quot;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve built a bank that feels human, not just functional. Our product &lt;em&gt;is&lt;/em&gt; our personality. We blend research, empathy, data and craft to turn everyday interactions into memorable experiences.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Right now, we’re growing fast and looking for passionate designers to shape Monzo’s future — and there’s a huge opportunity to make your mark.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🌱 About Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Growth collective is focused on helping more people discover Monzo, understand what makes us different, and find the products that can make money work better for them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For this role, you’ll have a particular focus on our &lt;strong&gt;web experiences&lt;/strong&gt;, helping us rethink how people discover, explore and choose Monzo before they ever open the app. You’ll combine strong visual and interaction design with a data-informed mindset, using experimentation and customer insight to understand what works and continuously improve the experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You don’t need to have worked in a dedicated Growth team before. We’re interested in designers who are curious about customer behaviour, comfortable using data to inform their decisions, and excited by the opportunity to apply exceptional craft to high-impact customer journeys.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔑You’ll play a key role by...&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading the design of high-quality web experiences that help new and existing customers discover the value Monzo can bring to their financial lives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using quantitative and qualitative data to identify opportunities, understand customer behaviour and make informed design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turning customer and business problems into clear hypotheses, designing experiments and using what you learn to shape what we do next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bringing exceptional visual and interaction craft to our web experiences, creating work that feels unmistakably Monzo while driving meaningful customer and commercial outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tackling complex and ambiguous design challenges, balancing customer needs, business goals and technical constraints to create simple, effective experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Defining compelling product visions and direction, helping teams think beyond individual experiments towards a coherent long-term customer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering closely with Product, Engineering, Data and Research throughout the design process, bringing people together around customer problems and opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Using AI to level-up parts of your design workflow. Whether that’s ideation, analysis, prototyping or shipping production code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking a pragmatic approach to experimentation — moving quickly when we need to learn, while knowing when an experience needs a higher level of craft and polish.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Acting as a role model in Design, sharing your work broadly, mentoring others, and contributing to the growth and success of the wider Design team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🤩 We’d love to hear from you if…&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven track record of designing &lt;strong&gt;high-quality web experiences&lt;/strong&gt;, with a portfolio that demonstrates strong visual and interaction design craft.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable using &lt;strong&gt;data to inform your design decisions&lt;/strong&gt;, partnering with Data Scientists or Analysts to understand customer behaviour and measure the impact of your work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can connect great customer experiences with measurable outcomes and understand how design can contribute to wider product and commercial goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable forming hypotheses, experimenting with different approaches and adapting your thinking as you learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can balance speed and experimentation with a high bar for craft, knowing when to prototype quickly and when to invest in creating an exceptional final experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a natural collaborator who can bring together Product, Engineering, Data, Research and other partners around complex customer problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You thrive in ambiguity and can create clarity and direction when the answer isn’t immediately obvious.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable thinking beyond an individual screen or experiment, connecting work across journeys and helping shape a longer-term vision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a role model who actively contributes to the growth of the Design team through mentoring, feedback and sharing your expertise.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re excited about Monzo’s mission to make money work for everyone and the opportunity to help more people discover the value of Monzo.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🙌What’s in it for you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;💰 £90,000 - £110,000 + Incentive Awards tied to your performance.&lt;br&gt;✈️ We’ll help you relocate to the UK.&lt;br&gt;✅ We can sponsor your visa.&lt;br&gt;📍This role can be based in our London office, but we&#39;re open to distributed working within the UK (with ad hoc meetings in London).&lt;br&gt;⏰We offer flexible working hours and trust you to work enough hours to do your job well, and at times that suit you and your team.&lt;br&gt;📚£1,000 learning budget each year to use on books, training courses and conferences.&lt;br&gt;🏡We will set you up to work from home; all employees are given Macbooks and for fully remote workers we will provide extra support for your work-from-home setup.&lt;br&gt;➕ Plus lots more!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;🌈 &lt;strong&gt;The application journey has 3 key steps&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;30-minute call with our Recruiter, Tom&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-hour craft interview where you’ll present a single case study to 2 members of our Design team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2 x 45-minute interviews covering Teamwork and Impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This process should take around 4 weeks - your schedule is really important to us, so we promise to be as flexible as possible!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We have some guidelines on using Artificial Intelligence (AI) to ace an application and interview at Monzo.&lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/the-ultimate-guide-on-using-ai-to-ace-an-interview-at-monzo&quot;&gt; You can read them here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ll only close this role once we have enough applications for the next stage. Please submit your application as soon as possible to make sure you don’t miss out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-TR1&lt;br&gt;#LI-Remote&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunities for everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Diversity and inclusion are a priority for us and we’re making sure we have lots of support for all of our people to grow at Monzo. At Monzo, we’re embracing diversity by fostering an inclusive environment for all people to do the best work of their lives with us. This is integral to our mission of making money work for everyone. You can read more in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/diversity-and-inclusion&quot;&gt;blog&lt;/a&gt;, 2026 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/our-2026-diversity-and-inclusion-report&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Diversity and Inclusion Report&lt;/a&gt; and 2025 &lt;a href=&quot;https://monzo.com/blog/gender-pay-gap-report-2025&quot;&gt;Gender Pay Gap Report.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re an equal opportunity employer. All applicants will be considered for employment without attention to age, ethnicity, religion, sex, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, or veteran, neurodiversity or disability status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you have a preferred name, please use it to apply. We don&#39;t need full or birth names at application stage 😊&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;4&quot;&gt;At HelloFresh, the goal is to change the way people eat forever by delivering high-quality food across 18 countries and 3 continents. As a global food solutions group and the world&#39;s leading meal kit provider, the portfolio includes HelloFresh, Green Chef, EveryPlate, Chefs Plate, Factor_, Youfoodz, Good Chop, and The Pets Table.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Engaging with HelloFresh in Warsaw means collaborating with &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;5&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;60&quot;&gt;HelloTech&lt;/strong&gt;—a global technology division of over 1,000 people powering an end-to-end food ecosystem. From digital personalization and forecasting to supply chain optimization and food waste reduction, technology drives every step of this direct-to-consumer model. HelloTech operates in autonomous, cross-functional alliances, with each team holding full accountability for a specific domain. By collaborating with the Warsaw office, the service provider will leverage a modern tech stack and work with international teams to shape scalable, data-driven platforms that impact millions of global customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;About the Role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;HelloFresh Group is building the next generation of consumer experiences across its portfolio—from discovery and personalization to shopping and subscription management. The Consumer UX team is at the heart of this work, designing end-to-end experiences that are simple, delightful, and grounded in real customer needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;9&quot;&gt;Services are required for Senior UX Designers across two squad contexts: one embedded in &lt;strong&gt;Good Chop&lt;/strong&gt;, the premium American meat and seafood subscription brand, and one in the &lt;strong&gt;central Consumer UX team&lt;/strong&gt; working across the broader HelloFresh Group portfolio. Both roles share the same craft bar, strategic expectations, and ways of working.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;10&quot;&gt;These are full-accountability roles inside a fast-paced environment. The provider will partner with Product and Engineering leads on a cross-functional squad, where UX serves as a strategic input to shape direction from the start. This role does not include people management responsibilities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;12&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do: The Recipe&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Consumer Experience Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead design from concept to shipped product, maintaining full accountability for the consumer experience across touchpoints while holding a high quality bar at every stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategy and Roadmap Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; Frame problem spaces before briefs are created. Bring evidence-backed consumer insights into squad planning to surface opportunities and inform what gets built.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Craft and Execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a high personal standard across UI, interaction design, motion, micro-interaction, and UX writing, using animation and motion as intentional strategic tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;13,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;13,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;AI-Native Workflow:&lt;/strong&gt; Utilize AI across the entire design lifecycle—including insight synthesis, discovery, rapid prototyping, and design-to-code workflows—to increase execution speed and precision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;15&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What You’ll Bring: The Ingredients&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 6+ years in product design, with a proven track record delivering high-quality consumer products end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Consumer Instinct:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep understanding of consumer-facing products and decision-making drivers across the full customer lifecycle. Subscription domain experience is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Range:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to define problem spaces before designing solutions, utilizing evidence to refine project scopes and contribute to roadmap strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Craft Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional visual and interaction design skills with deep focus on hierarchy, motion, micro-interaction, and animation. High proficiency in Figma and strong familiarity with front-end technical constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;High Agency:&lt;/strong&gt; Proactivity to advocate for optimal design solutions, bringing conviction to decisions and collaborating effectively with cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Research Fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Ability to frame research questions, run lightweight studies, and translate findings into design direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;AI-Native in Practice:&lt;/strong&gt; Active use of AI tools (such as Figma AI and Claude) in live project workflows for synthesis, discovery, prototyping, and code generation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;16,7,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;16,7,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Clear presentation capabilities, skill in facilitating cross-functional alignment, and the ability to defend design decisions using data and evidence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;18&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;What We Offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;19,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;19,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;19,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence design quality, architecture, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;19,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;19,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;19,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Access to workspace at Warsaw Centre Point:&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;21&quot;&gt;#PRODUCT #DESIGN&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Work with HelloFresh in Warsaw and its HelloTech organisation, HelloFresh’s global technology backbone with more than 1000 people, building the digital products that power our end-to-end food experience. From meal kits and ready-to-eat meals to specialty offerings like pet food and premium meat &amp;amp; seafood, HelloTech creates the platforms that bring tailored food solutions to millions of customers every month.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our subscription-based, direct-to-consumer model relies on technology at every step, from customer-facing apps and personalization logic to pricing, forecasting, supply chain optimization, and initiatives that help reduce food waste. While our brands operate independently to serve distinct customer needs, they are united by shared platforms, data, and operational excellence built by HelloTech.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloTech works in autonomous, cross-functional alliances, each owning a specific product or domain end to end. By working with our Warsaw office, you will help shape scalable, data-driven products used across our markets, working with a modern tech stack and international teams to continuously improve how people discover, order, and enjoy HelloFresh’s products, today and in the future.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role: What&#39;s in the Box&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior UX Product Designer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This is a hybrid role to our Toronto HelloFresh Headquarters&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HelloFresh is seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Designer to join our Growth UX team&lt;/strong&gt;, shaping how prospective and returning customers discover, evaluate, and choose HelloFresh across our portfolio of brands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior-level individual contributor, you’ll lead complex, high-impact growth challenges across acquisition, conversion, checkout, reactivation, and new purchase experiences. You’ll combine strong product design craft with experimentation, systems thinking, and commercial awareness to create experiences that are intuitive, relevant, and effective.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a strategic and hands-on role. You’ll contribute to the future direction of our growth experiences while continuously identifying opportunities to improve what exists today. You’ll work in an &lt;strong&gt;AI-native design environment&lt;/strong&gt;, using AI throughout the design lifecycle to accelerate discovery, synthesis, prototyping, and execution — while applying strong judgment around where AI improves the quality of the customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Senior level, we expect you to independently lead ambiguous product challenges, influence product direction, and contribute patterns and practices that make the broader team stronger. You’ll remain deeply involved in the craft, using the quality of your thinking, design, and collaboration to bring others along.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead high-impact Growth experiences&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the end-to-end design of critical growth journeys across acquisition, conversion, checkout, payment, reactivation, and emerging purchase models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex customer and business problems into experiences that clearly communicate value, reduce friction, and help customers confidently make decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Balance immediate conversion opportunities with the longer-term customer experience, considering not only whether customers convert, but whether we are setting them up for meaningful engagement and retention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape product direction&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Engineering, Data, Research, Marketing, and Content Design to identify opportunities across the customer journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect customer needs, behavioural insights, commercial goals, and emerging technology to develop strong product directions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Move comfortably between contributing to longer-term vision and delivering tactical improvements that generate measurable impact today.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring a strong design perspective to your product area while remaining open to evidence, experimentation, and the expertise of your partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive experimentation and validated learning&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use quantitative and qualitative insights to identify opportunities, develop hypotheses, and design high-impact experiments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with Product and Data to understand performance across the funnel and translate learnings into actionable design improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Look beyond the outcome of individual A/B tests to identify patterns and insights that can inform future product and design decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help teams balance experimentation velocity with customer comprehension, trust, and experience quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work AI-natively&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate AI into your day-to-day design practice, from exploration, research synthesis, and ideation through rapid prototyping and design-to-code workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use tools such as Claude &amp;amp; Claude Code, Gemini, Figma AI, and emerging technologies to shorten the distance between an idea and something customers can experience and validate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore opportunities for AI-native customer experiences, including personalization, recommendations, adaptive journeys, and conversational interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply strong design judgment to AI-generated outputs, understanding when AI accelerates quality and when human craft, intuition, and critical thinking matter most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Raise the bar for design craft&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create polished, intuitive experiences with strong attention to visual hierarchy, interaction design, motion, micro-interactions, content, and overall usability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve the quality and coherence of the Growth experiences you work on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute patterns, practices, and examples that help other designers deliver stronger work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Give and seek thoughtful critique, using feedback to continuously strengthen the work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design systems, not just screens&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Think across journeys rather than individual touchpoints, identifying opportunities to create reusable patterns and modular experiences that can scale across markets, brands, customer types, and purchase models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with our design system teams while contributing to Growth-specific patterns where needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help reduce design debt and fragmentation by creating solutions that make future experimentation faster without sacrificing relevance or quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead through collaboration&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring strong perspectives and clear rationale to complex product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide cross-functional partners through ambiguity and trade-offs, advocating for customer-centred solutions while understanding commercial and technical constraints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build alignment through clear communication, evidence, and strong design rationale rather than formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support other designers through critique, collaboration, and sharing new practices and approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior-level product design experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Typically &lt;strong&gt;4-6+ years of product design experience&lt;/strong&gt;, although we care more about the scope, complexity, and impact of your work than years alone.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong portfolio demonstrating end-to-end ownership of complex consumer experiences, from understanding the problem through shipped outcomes and learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience independently navigating ambiguous problems, making sound design decisions, and influencing product direction within your area.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth and experimentation expertise&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience designing B2C growth, e-commerce, subscription, marketplace, or other transaction-driven experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand experimentation deeply and can translate behavioural data, customer insights, and business metrics into meaningful design opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know how to optimize for conversion without losing sight of trust, comprehension, customer value, and longer-term engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional product design craft&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise across interaction and visual design, including hierarchy, information architecture, responsive behaviour, motion, and micro-interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can take complex experiences and make them feel simple, and can articulate what separates a functional experience from a great one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You care about the details while understanding when speed, learning, and iteration matter more than perfection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI-native design fluency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AI is already part of how you work, not something you are waiting to adopt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You regularly use AI across multiple stages of your design process, whether that’s discovery, synthesis, ideation, prototyping, or execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable experimenting with tools such as Figma AI, Claude, Claude Code, Gemini, or similar emerging technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re interested not only in using AI to work faster, but in understanding how it changes what we can design for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Systems thinking&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You naturally look beyond the individual screen or experiment to understand how experiences connect.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience creating reusable patterns or modular solutions that can work across journeys, customer contexts, brands, or markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can balance the benefits of consistency and reuse with the need to design for the specific customer problem at hand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic thinking and high agency&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable navigating ambiguity, challenging assumptions, and proactively identifying opportunities rather than waiting for perfectly defined briefs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You bring conviction to your design decisions while remaining open to evidence, experimentation, and alternative perspectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can establish a strong direction for your work and then get hands-on to make it real.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-functional leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable working beyond traditional design boundaries: shaping product decisions with Product Managers, exploring technical possibilities with Engineers, working with Data to understand performance, and partnering with Research and Content Design to understand customer behaviour.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You know how to build alignment across disciplines and move work forward without relying on formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Exceptional communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can turn complex problems into clear, compelling narratives and confidently present your thinking to stakeholders at different levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate not only &lt;strong&gt;what&lt;/strong&gt; you designed, but the customer insight, hypothesis, trade-offs, and business rationale behind it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can adapt the depth and format of your communication to the decision that needs to be made.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Above all, we are looking for individuals who will &lt;strong&gt;make HelloFresh better.&lt;/strong&gt; We believe there are many different ways of developing skills and we love diverse experiences! So even if you don’t “tick all the boxes” but think you’d thrive in this role, we would really like to learn more about you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer: The Toppings&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global collaboration at scale:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate with experienced engineers and product partners across HelloTech’s international teams, in a culture of active knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technology with real-world impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and operate modern systems at global scale, supporting 6+ millions of customers and complex supply chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical/Product/Design leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive best practices and influence architecture/design, quality, and ways of working in an autonomous, product-led setup.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;End-to-end development/delivery:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive decisions from problem definition to production, improving systems and enabling long-term scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Access to workspace at Warsaw Centre Point.&lt;/strong&gt; The hub offers modern facilities including showers, breakout zones, outdoor space, cycle parking, and refreshments (coffee, soft drinks, and fruit).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you the missing ingredient? If this sounds like a tasty opportunity, we’d be excited to hear from you.&amp;nbsp; We aim to review your profile and respond within 5 business days.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-HYBRID #Design&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;The Design team at Raisin brings together product designers and brand &amp;amp; marketing designers; we are united by our shared belief in the power of respect, creativity, and the purpose to give people financial peace of mind.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;We’ve built a place where empathy and innovation thrive, where integrity and high quality standards underpin our work. We love our diversity and use the strength of our perspectives to reach our goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Design &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principles&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are supportive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Build confidence by removing the unnecessary and focusing on what matters. Reveal information, features, and controls progressively to create a secure, transparent, accurate, relevant, and consistent experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We create delight&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Make every design engaging and enjoyable. Use strong visuals, clear data, and thoughtful copy. Treat design quality as essential. Add moments of surprise and joy whenever possible.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We act universal&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;Design smart experiences that adapt to user behavior, use context, and anticipate intent. Keep interfaces familiar, welcoming, and clear yet advanced. Make every interaction simple and intuitive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are authentic&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Bring your whole self and ensure diversity of perspectives. Speak plainly, disagree respectfully, support each other, commit fully, and celebrate progress together.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create desirable, usable digital products and features&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;Own design activities to launch and improve features that help customers register, authenticate, manage their accounts, and make payments. Look for places where AI can make complex interactions simpler.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;Own design activities to improve internal customer-service and operations tools to help serve our customer base.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;Lead rapid prototyping activities. Use generative and agentic tools to turn bold concepts into something people can try and share feedback on.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;Support larger end-to-end design discovery and delivery, guided by more senior design peers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hold the bar on quality and ethical guardrails&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;Make quality a habit: validate quickly, and iterate. Use qualitative research, operational metrics, and security and compliance feedback to keep UX guardrails clear and real.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;Run feedback loops so AI-generated work meets a high ethical and quality standard.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate across functions&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;Work with product managers, engineers, and data specialists to design and ship high-quality experiences. Be proactive in the way you work together.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;Partner with peers, engineers, and data specialists to experiment and to put in place the UX infrastructure for AI-driven features. Co-create products that are personal and highly secure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;Tell a clear story. Explain your design intent, choices, and trade-offs to team and stakeholders. Ask for feedback, and give it clearly and openly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn technical and compliance requirements into usable experiences&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;Translate complex backend and platform capabilities, including AI/ML models and agentic logic, into interfaces that customers and internal teams can easily use.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;Surface compliance requirements, for customers and for internal customer-service teams, and use them to shape experiences that are robust and friendly at the same time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to a living design system&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;Adopt reusable, flexible UX patterns, and add new ones when needed, so we make micro-frontends look - and feel - cohesive.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;Work closely with the team responsible for the Raisin Design System, so components and patterns stay accessible, consistent and well documented across platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;Help the live design system grow: contribute spec-to-code delivery of components and scalable UX patterns when they support the features, services, and experiences you are designing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay curious, and keep experimenting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;Keep your craft fresh. Stay current on AI capabilities and on how design work changes when agents are in the loop, so Raisin’s design practice stays sharp.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;3+ years in product design, ideally in fintech, platform services, or another highly regulated, complex environment (for example healthtech, legaltech, or high-stakes SaaS) where trust, long-term decisions, and compliance really matter.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;A portfolio that shows strong product design experience in complex products and systems: user-centered methods, and real examples of AI/ML-driven features, agentic workflows, or conversational interfaces.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;A clear understanding of how to design for AI: system uncertainty, predictability, user trust, error prevention, and &quot;&lt;em&gt;human-in-the-loop&lt;/em&gt;&quot; feedback mechanisms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;Practice with user-driven validation techniques: qualitative, quantitative, and analytics-based.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;A good grasp of how to design with generative and agentic tools, both to explore concepts faster and to build high-fidelity work, for delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;Ability to take active part in cross-functional workshops, including with engineering-heavy partners such as data scientists and AI/ML engineers: ask the deep questions, translate design language into ways other functions will grasp, seek active co-creation and elicit feedback.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;A data-informed mindset. Comfortable working with security, compliance, operational KPIs, and AI system metrics (model accuracy, latency, user feedback loops).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;Strong storytelling that keeps stakeholders and peers with you - as you walk them through your design decisions - including the ability to explain complex AI logic or automated systems in simple, human terms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;A proactive learner. You already use AI-augmented workflows (research synthesis, copywriting, ideation, delivery) to work faster without lowering the quality bar.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
