&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(2, 25, 61);&quot;&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
